# The official daychat server, built into the client.
#
# One line: <host:port> <full certificate fingerprint>
# daychat-server prints the full fingerprint when it starts.
# The client joins this server automatically and accepts only exactly this
# certificate. Leave it without a server line to build a client without one.
#
# Example:
# chat.example.org:7878 3f2a91c07b44e1d20a9f...(64 hex characters)
